    "created_at": "2016-04-25T19:27:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-25T19:27:12Z",
    "body": "Yes, I think whenever client and referrer should be the same things were working correctly. It's for modules where I'm not sure what the correct referrer should be. For the top-level module of a worker I expect the same referrer as what is passed for classic workers. Not sure if for imported modules the referrer should be the client or the module that imported the module being fetched.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
