    "created_at": "2016-04-25T23:02:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-25T23:02:31Z",
    "body": "Right, I see. Now I get your puzzlement about why the settings object is created first, then the fetch done with it, instead of fetching the script before any settings object or realm creation happens.\n\n@annevk (and @mkruisselbrink), could you help me understand the consequences of switching the worker fetch's client from the settings object inside the worker, to a different settings object? Would it be the incumbent settings object or entry settings object? ([Worker uses both](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#dom-worker).) How is this observable, and can we test implementations? Maybe @bzbarsky or @bholley have thoughts, as they often do about settings objects.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/214557089/reactions",
