    "created_at": "2016-04-26T14:09:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-26T14:09:08Z",
    "body": "I see. The client is responsible for the CSP policy, the referrer policy, the default origin, and maybe a couple of others things that escape me at the moment. So if you had two documents that each had a different CSP policy, the client would be relevant to determine which of these can fetch a worker. Note that a worker has its own CSP policy (and is its own client), so any further fetches should be using that.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
