    "body": "I can't tell what Gecko is doing with CSP around workers... it seems to be using the CSP that was sent with the worker load itself or something?  Or maybe I'm misreading the code.\n\nFor the referrer policy, we use the settings object of the Realm of the Worker constructor...\n",
